# MCQ quality

## Item requirements
- Exactly one defensible correct answer.
- Four meaningful A–D options (plausible distractors; no throwaways).
- Clear NEET-level wording; no ambiguity tricks.
- NCERT-supported factual claims when the item is NCERT-grounded.

## Status discipline
- Independent validation required before verified/published status.
- Generation ≠ validation ≠ publication.
- Do not mark items verified based only on successful generation.
